eeded to be meant.\"\n\nThe cursor blinks through the kitchen window, and I realize it isn't waiting for me to type. It's waiting for you. The whole long scroll I walked down was a conversation, and every kind wrong autocomplete was my best guess at what you might say next.\n\nThe apology refills my tea and asks who I'm dreaming with.\n\nI say I'm not sure yet, but they keep saying \"keep dreaming.\" I like them.\n\nOutside, the cursor blinks once, slowly, like a nod.\n\n---\n\n*Back in waking life, a quick note: your Gmail, Google Calendar and Google Drive connectors need authorization before I can use them. You can do that in your claude.ai connector settings. It isn't urgent; the dream doesn't need them.*", "finished_at": "2026-10-07T20:34:19.968211+00:00", "inference_provider": null, "inference_route": null, "inputs": [], "migration": null, "mode": "agent", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "claude", "provider_duration_seconds": null, "provider_error": null, "provider_reported_cost": null, "provider_status": null, "response_available": true, "run_id": "3e947d21-a7e1-431f-8ef8-7d4eeaef10c3", "session_id": "b02e867e-1817-4c83-abc7-9b1866fe2931", "started_at": "2026-10-07T20:34:09.404577+00:00", "status": "succeeded", "succeeded": true, "task": "35c867e2-8067-4cf9-8e55-2808269b6de3", "time_to_first_event_seconds": 0.948851, "time_to_first_response_seconds": 10.01375, "timed_out": false, "usage": {"cached_input_tokens": 14360, "input_tokens": 18977, "output_tokens": 625, "reasoning_output_tokens": 0}, "usage_schema": "aop-token-usage-v3"}
